=\"btn\" href=\"/order.php\">Order a coffee</a>\n    <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/menu.php\">Browse the menu</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <h2>Barista picks</h2>\n  <div class=\"cards\">\n          <article class=\"card\">\n        <h3>Null Byte Latte</h3>\n        <p>Silky steamed milk that ends a little earlier than expected.</p>\n        <div class=\"card-foot\">\n          <span class=\"price\">$4.50</span>\n          <a class=\"btn small\" href=\"/order.php?item=3\">Order</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n          <article class=\"card\">\n        <h3>Buffer Overflow Mocha</h3>\n        <p>Extra chocolate, extra shot. Spills over the cup boundary.</p>\n        <div class=\"card-foot\">\n          <span class=\"price\">$5.25</span>\n          <a class=\"btn small\" href=\"/order.php?item=4\">Order</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n          <article class=\"card\">\n        <h3>Honeypot Oat Latte</h3>\n        <p>Sweetened with honey. Suspiciously inviting.</p>\n        <div class=\"card-foot\">\n          <span class=\"price\">$5.00</span>\n          <a class=\"btn small\" href=\"/order.php?item=9\">Order</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section split\">\n  <div>\n    <h2>Now brewing</h2>\n    <ul class=\"board\">\n              <li>\n          <strong>TESTY</strong>\n          <span>Medium Buffer Overflow Mocha</span>\n        </li>\n              <li>\n          <strong>Taylor</strong>\n          <span>Large Packet Loss Matcha</span>\n        </li>\n              <li>\n          <strong>Dev</strong>\n          <span>Small Root Shell Cortado</span>\n        </li>\n              <li>\n          <strong>Elena</strong>\n          <span>Medium Cold Boot Cold Brew</span>\n        </li>\n              <li>\n          <strong>Marcus</strong>\n          <span>Small Zero-Day Espresso</span>\n        </li>\n              <li>\n          <strong>Priya</strong>\n          <span>Large Null Byte Latte</span>\n        </li>\n          </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"about\">\n    <h2>About us</h2>\n    <p>Neil and Avi started roasting packets in a dorm room with one rule: every cup is\n       brewed to order and delivered over HTTP. Nothing to spill, nothing to pay, and\n       the line is never longer than your bandwidth.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n  <p>Neil and Avi's Coffee Shop · Est. 2026 · Serving virtual coffee to real hackers</p>\n  <p class=\"fine\">All drinks are imaginary. No beans were harmed. <a href=\"/admin/login.php\">Staff</a></p>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","http_code":200,"headers":{"Server":"nginx","Server":"nginx","Date":"Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:34:06 GMT","Content-Type":"text/html; charset=UTF-8","Connection":"keep-alive","Cache-Control":"no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate","Pragma":"no-cache","X-Powered-By":"PHP/8.3.35","Set-Cookie":"PHPSESSID=421884bf17e33ce023502c895aa2a168; path=/; HttpOnly","Expires":"Thu, 19 Nov 1981 08:52:00 GMT","Access-Control-Allow-Headers":"*"}},"producer":{"modsecurity":"ModSecurity v3.0.17 (Linux)","connector":"ModSecurity-nginx v1.0.4","secrules_engine":"DetectionOnly","components":["OWASP_CRS/4.30.0\""]},"messages":[{"message":"Host header is a numeric IP address","details":{"match":"Matched \"Operator `Rx' with parameter `(?:^([\\d.]+|\\[[\\da-f:]+\\]|[\\da-f:]+)(:[\\d]+)?$)' against variable `REQUEST_HEADERS:Host' (Value: `20.42.115.173' )","reference":"o0,13o0,13v21,13","ruleId":"920350","file":"/etc/modsecurity.d/owasp-crs/rules/REQUEST-920-PROTOCOL-ENFORCEMENT.conf","lineNumber":"756","data":"20.42.115.173","severity":"4","ver":"OWASP_CRS/4.30.0","rev":"","tags":["modsecurity","application-multi","language-multi","platform-multi","attack-protocol","paranoia-level/1","OWASP_CRS","OWASP_CRS/PROTOCOL-ENFORCEMENT","capec/1000/210/272"],"maturity":"0","accuracy":"0"}}]}}
